From: Bastiaan van der Plaat <bastiaan.v.d.plaat@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:31:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Preprocess resource scripts with tcc

windres runs gcc to preprocess resource scripts, the Windows XP
development kit has TinyCC.
---
 binutils/resrc.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/binutils/resrc.c b/binutils/resrc.c
index 130ff7b..0e086a3 100644
--- a/binutils/resrc.c
+++ b/binutils/resrc.c
@@ -75,7 +75,7 @@
 
 /* The default preprocessor.  */
 
-#define DEFAULT_PREPROCESSOR_CMD "gcc"
+#define DEFAULT_PREPROCESSOR_CMD "tcc"
 #define DEFAULT_PREPROCESSOR_ARGS "-E -xc -DRC_INVOKED"
 
 /* We read the directory entries in a cursor or icon file into
